          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether the Constitution requires either federal or state law to permit a partial verdict."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a424ed6dde87ec6cf4694435c79bcb30eaaa00c1ed9d93ee1d592790c647b1b5",
            "evidence_ids": [
