            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts thanked counsel."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a424ed6dde87ec6cf4694435c79bcb30eaaa00c1ed9d93ee1d592790c647b1b5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a424ed6dde87-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg inquired about the government\u2019s actions on its second chance."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a424ed6dde87ec6cf4694435c79bcb30eaaa00c1ed9d93ee1d592790c647b1b5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a424ed6dde87-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kennedy, justice Kennedy posed a hypothetical about multiple hung juries and district\u2011court discretion to dismiss charges."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a424ed6dde87ec6cf4694435c79bcb30eaaa00c1ed9d93ee1d592790c647b1b5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a424ed6dde87-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens noted that a hung jury followed by a second after an acquittal is not customary."
      }
    ],
